            <div xml:id="d346">

                <pb facs="0318" n="306" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg306"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">845.5018/59: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Officer in Charge at New Delhi</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Merrell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New Delhi</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-10-11T19:00:00+06:30">October 11, 1943—7
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received October 11—3:46 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>743. Reference Department’s 538, October 9, 8 p.m. Release of statement deferred
                    pending Department’s reply to Mission’s 727 October 8 unless Department
                    instructs otherwise. External Affairs informs Mission their request made at
                    instance His Majesty’s Government after Food Department had requested His
                    Majesty’s Government to approach Government United States.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Merrell</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
